Starting success criteria
Agree these with each school; do not impose them as universal benchmarks:
At least 90% of scheduled pilot attendance sessions completed in FutureSchool.
At least 70% of invited parents activate and view one relevant item.
Baseline and end-of-pilot time measured for the chosen workflow.
Teacher and admin support requests documented.
Principal confirms whether visibility improved.
No unresolved critical privacy, security, data-loss or financial defect.
Written decision: convert, extend for a defined reason, or stop.
Avoid indefinite free pilots. They attract low-commitment prospects and conceal implementation cost.
