13. Sales funnel
Target: school meets basic ICP.
Research: size, board, leadership, current system and likely trigger identified.
Connect: two-way conversation with a relevant stakeholder.
Discover: pain, impact, buyer, timing and current workflow documented.
Qualify: meaningful problem, sponsor and plausible budget exist.
Demo: show only the two relevant workflows.
Pilot: paid, scoped and measured.
Proposal: student count, package, implementation, charges and renewal clearly stated.
Decision: won or lost with reason.
Onboarding: data, configuration, training and go-live.
Adoption: usage and support reviewed.
Renewal: value review begins 90–120 days before renewal.
Referral/expansion: requested only after measurable value.
Never count a school as pipeline merely because its phone number was collected.
